OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRemaining largely dry with the
OL,6,Fchance of an isolated coastal shower.
OL,7,FSpells of sunshine, although the
OL,8,Fsunshine maybe rather hazy at times.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average for the
OL,10,Ftime of year.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry and settled evening,
OL,13,Fcloudy for the most with winds
OL,14,Fbecoming light and variable, though
OL,15,Fremaining breezy along the coast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FTurning cloudy with some sunny
OL,18,Fspells, especially during the
OL,19,Fafternoon and clearing skies
OL,20,Fovernight. Feeling very warm in light
OL,21,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
